some raunchy stuff,

2265
01:23:42,752 --> 01:23:44,887
but that's disgusting.

2266
01:23:44,887 --> 01:23:46,990
(chants)

2267
01:23:50,427 --> 01:23:51,427
- [Mike] Should have never had

2268
01:23:51,427 --> 01:23:54,097
those little Vietnamese peppers.

2269
01:23:56,332 --> 01:23:58,067
- The man is a pig.

2270
01:23:58,067 --> 01:24:00,303
(growls)

2271
01:24:00,303 --> 01:24:04,207
- [Tom] Eh, it's just
a cry for attention.

2272
01:24:04,207 --> 01:24:07,710
- [Mike] Rick Baker,
you've done it again.

2273
01:24:10,313 --> 01:24:13,450
(gun firing)

2274
01:24:13,450 --> 01:24:16,385
- [Tom] You shot
me, you son of a--

2275
01:24:21,057 --> 01:24:24,993
- The paperwork's really
mounting here, sir.

2276
01:24:24,993 --> 01:24:25,828
(laughs)

2277
01:24:25,828 --> 01:24:26,662
- [Tom] Case closed.

2278
01:24:26,662 --> 01:24:28,163
How about a drink?

2279
01:24:29,365 --> 01:24:30,867
- [Frank] What are you
gonna do now, Captain?

2280
01:24:30,867 --> 01:24:32,502
You gonna kill me, too?

2281
01:24:32,502 --> 01:24:34,837
- I've got no choice, Frank.

2282
01:24:35,805 --> 01:24:37,240
- [Mike] Well, that backfired.

2283
01:24:37,240 --> 01:24:39,542
- [Man] Come on, Frank,
take it like a man.

2284
01:24:39,542 --> 01:24:40,910
(growls)

2285
01:24:40,910 --> 01:24:41,743
- [Mike] What the.

2286
01:24:41,743 --> 01:24:42,978
(gun firing)

2287
01:24:42,978 --> 01:24:43,780
This isn't a very
